# The Navigator lists Upcoming, Overdue and Logbook after Today, counting the open tasks each lists, and Enter on Overdue shows it.
file <<END
Work:
	- Late A @due({today-2})
	- Late B @due({today-1})
	- Soon @due({today+2})
	- Done @done({today})
	Late project: @due({today-1})
END
keys <C-g>
see Navigator
see 󱄵 Upcoming                                1 │
see 󰨱 Overdue                                 2 │
see 󱓳 Logbook
keys <Down> <Down>
keys <Enter>
see 󰨱 Overdue
see 2 days ago ·
see Late project:  Work
